set.body:
Migrate kernel, Gram, and Nystrom paths onto the unified operator representation without confusing kernel roles with covariance, metric, or row-relation roles.

Scope:
- certified kernel/Gram roles and evidence-preserving adapters;
- matrix-free and low-rank representations in Op;
- Nystrom landmarks, extension maps, and fit artifacts;
- explicit chart/space identities for out-of-sample transforms;
- removal of dependencies on MvMetric, MvMap, DualityDiagram, and raw GenPca.

Acceptance:
- current kernel and Nystrom JVM/JS tests pass;
- full-kernel versus Nystrom differential fixtures cover exact and approximate regimes;
- PSD/evidence downgrade and failure paths are tested;
- representation tests prove no accidental dense materialization;
- out-of-sample transforms preserve nominal spaces and provenance.
